## 3. First Bad Version – LeetCode #278

**Difficulty:** Easy

**Concept:** Use Binary Search to find the first bad version while minimizing API calls.

**Time Complexity:** O(log n)  
**Space Complexity:** O(1)

```java
// The isBadVersion API is provided by LeetCode.
public class Solution extends VersionControl {
    public int firstBadVersion(int n) {
        int left = 1;
        int right = n;

        while (left < right) {
            int mid = left + (right - left) / 2;

            if (isBadVersion(mid)) {
                right = mid;
            } else {
                left = mid + 1;
            }
        }

        return left;
    }
}
```

