## 5. Kth Largest Element in an Array – LeetCode #215

**Difficulty:** Medium

**Concept:** Sort the array in ascending order. The Kth largest element is located at index `nums.length - k`.

**Time Complexity:** O(n log n)  
**Auxiliary Space Complexity:** Depends on Java's sorting implementation.

```java
import java.util.Arrays;

class Solution {
    public int findKthLargest(int[] nums, int k) {
        Arrays.sort(nums);
        return nums[nums.length - k];
    }
}
```

[LeetCode Problem](https://leetcode.com/problems/kth-largest-element-in-an-array/)

